### Terrain Grid System 2 ###
# A paid asset from the Unity Asset Store (Kronnect). This repository is public, so the package itself is not in it.
# Import it from the Asset Store into Assets/TerrainGridSystem before opening the project; the game only needs the
# Kronnect.TerrainGridSystem assembly, which the grid of the map is drawn with.
/[Aa]ssets/TerrainGridSystem/
/[Aa]ssets/TerrainGridSystem.meta

